  "ImporterDescription": "Mods that will be installed by install group:\r\n - LE3 Community Patch & Framework\r\n - Myriad Pro Begone (LE3)\r\n - Journal Enhanced (LE3)\r\n - Permanent CIC Holograms\r\n - FISH (Plus Kelly)\r\n - Diana Allers Overhaul\r\n - Fate of Emily Wong LE3\r\n - Reegar Lives\r\n - Apartment Additions\r\n - Pinnacle Station Apartment (LE3)\r\n - Datapad App Messages Expanded\r\n - Remove Enemy Smoke Grenades\r\n - No Movement Penalty During Rannoch Boss Fight\r\n - Infinite Ammo in Geth Consensus\r\n - Oriana looks like Miranda's Twin (ME3LE)\r\n - Unique Kahlee Sanders\r\n - Kasumi Eye Tweak LE3\r\n - Dreams Remade\r\n - Expanded Universe - Mod Menu\r\n - Expanded Galaxy Mod (LE)\r\n - WiredTexan's Shorter Notifications (LE3)\r\n - Omega Hub\r\n - Miranda Mod (LE3)\r\n - N7: A Spectre's Gift\r\n - Citadel Epilogue Mod (FULL)\r\n - Audemus' Happy Ending Mod\r\n - Armax Expansion Mod\r\n - Harbinger Overhaul Mod\r\n - LE3 Diversification Project\r\n - Liara Mourns the Dead\r\n - Spectre Expansion Mod\r\n - Reaper Retrofits\r\n - Take Earth Back\r\n - Leviathan Retrofits\r\n - Geth Retrofits\r\n - Cerberus Retrofits\r\n - Reworked Kai Leng\r\n - CAT6 Retrofits\r\n - Unique Udina Face Restored LE3\r\n - Subtle Ammo Icons (LE3)\r\n - LE3 Opening Remaster\r\n - A Lot of Videos for LE3\r\n - AutoTOC (ASI mod)\r\n - PNG Screenshots (ASI mod)\r\n - Texture Override (ASI mod)\r\n\nImporting will add this install group to Batch Installer. This does not import any of the listed mods."
